{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"alias":"feeblish-corporate-nyala","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Context\nBug 714b-0b2c-a8f9-468e corrects the alarm_description text in infra/terraform/monitoring_s4b.tf from 3 of 5 to 3 of 6 periods. CloudWatch keeps the old text until Terraform is applied; applying is an operator step.\n\n## Approach\nAfter the change is on main, an operator runs the normal Terraform plan and apply for the monitoring stack and confirms the plan changes only this alarm's description.\n\n## Testing\nRead-only check after apply: aws cloudwatch describe-alarms --alarm-names rebar-gerrit-voter-errors, reading AlarmDescription.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The live AlarmDescription says 3 of 6 five-minute periods (checked: describe-alarms output recorded in a ticket comment).\n","id":"0812-5f3f-3121-4d05","parent_id":"","priority":4,"tags":["terraform","ops","alarm"],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Apply the corrected rebar-gerrit-voter-errors alarm description"},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1792837115745606001,"uuid":"709fd2a1-81b4-4e88-a9bf-e2c0475fdb9a"}